Source code availability: NONE for the native cheat core. The only source
present in the workspace is FemboyLose-main/, which is the loader/injector
source (C++) plus embedded Lua libraries — not the cheat core. bins\nl.bin
(55,578,624 bytes) contains Lua standard library bytecode only; greps for
aim/ragebot/hitscan/aimbot/aim_position/aim_angle/aim_origin/best_target
return zero hits. Rust server code is networking/auth, not cheat logic.
Therefore every address and function below was recovered from live process
